WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.220 line:85%
At sunrise, the otter
was asleep on your bank,

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.000 line:85%
with breakfast still in reach.

3
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.060 line:85%
Mistral dipped her pen.

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.360 line:85%
Cell 7 is on her map for good.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.560 line:85%
Ember's radio is resting for the season.

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.480 line:85%
I'm keeping her channel open.

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.580 line:85%
The weather's turning,

8
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.860 line:85%
like the morning I first
gave you this island.

9
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.780 line:85%
Tonight there are ten animals on Cell 7.

10
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.420 line:85%
On your page it says 'viable'.

11
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.180 line:85%
Underneath, I'm writing 'worth keeping'.

12
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.660 line:85%
Here's the rain settling in.

13
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.160 line:85%
One lamp on the Lumen shelf has gone out.

14
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.200 line:85%
I'll stay up with the rain, keeper.
